# @name: openssl | Convert DER to PEM
# @description: Converts a DER certificate to PEM format Group: Certificate Management. Template: replace placeholders before running. {der_file} = Input DER certificate file [default "cert.der"] | {pem_file} = Output PEM certificate file [default "cert.pem"]
openssl x509 -inform der -in {der_file} -out {pem_file}